---
// 計算結果・内訳表示コンポーネント
---

<div class="result-container" aria-live="polite">
  <!-- サマリーカード: 支給見込総額 -->
  <div class="summary-card">
    <div class="summary-header">
      <span class="summary-badge">支給総額</span>
      <h2 class="summary-title">生活保護費 支給見込月額</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="total-amount-box">
      <span class="total-currency">¥</span>
      <span id="res-total-amount" class="total-number">0</span>
      <span class="total-period">/ 月</span>
    </div>

    <!-- 実質手元生活費ハイライトバー -->
    <div class="effective-living-bar">
      <div class="effective-label-group">
        <span class="effective-title">手元に残る実質生活費（可処分額）:</span>
        <span class="effective-sub">食費・光熱費・雑費などに使える金額</span>
      </div>
      <div class="effective-amount-box">
        <span class="effective-currency">¥</span>
        <strong id="res-effective-living" class="effective-number">0</strong>
        <span class="effective-unit">/月</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="res-winter-hint" class="winter-hint-bar">
      <span class="winter-icon">❄️</span>
      <span>冬季加算適用時（地区により10月〜翌4月のうち5〜7か月）: </span>
      <strong id="res-winter-total" class="winter-amount">¥0</strong> / 月
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 詳細内訳カード -->
  <div class="breakdown-card">
    <h3 class="breakdown-title">支給額の内訳と共益費の精算</h3>

    <div class="breakdown-list">
      <!-- 1. 生活扶助本体 -->
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <div class="item-main">
          <div class="item-label-group">
            <span class="item-name">生活扶助（本体）</span>
            <span class="item-sub">日常の食費・水道光熱費・日用品費</span>
          </div>
          <span class="item-amount">¥<span id="res-livelihood-amount">0</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="item-details">
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>第1類（個人経費・合算）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-cat1-sum">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>世帯逓減率（<span id="res-member-count-desc">1</span>人世帯）:</span>
            <span><span id="res-reduction-rate">100</span>% (¥<span id="res-cat1-reduced">0</span>)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>第2類（世帯共通経費）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-cat2">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>経過的加算（世帯員ごとの合算）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-transitional-addition">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>基準生活費（10円未満切上）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-base-amount">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>特例加算（月2,500円×<span id="res-special-count">1</span>人）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-special-addition">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row" id="row-year-end" hidden>
            <span>期末一時扶助（12月のみ）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-year-end">0</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. 各種加算 -->
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <div class="item-main">
          <div class="item-label-group">
            <span class="item-name">各種加算（計）</span>
            <span class="item-sub">児童養育・ひとり親・障害状況に応じた加算</span>
          </div>
          <span class="item-amount">¥<span id="res-total-additions">0</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="item-details">
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>児童養育加算（18歳以下 <span id="res-child-count">0</span>人）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-child-care-addition">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row detail-sub" id="row-child-care-transitional" hidden>
            <span>うち経過的加算（4,330円×<span id="res-child-care-transitional-count">0</span>人）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-child-care-transitional">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>母子加算（ひとり親世帯）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-single-parent-addition">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row detail-sub" id="row-single-parent-transitional" hidden>
            <span>うち経過的加算:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-single-parent-transitional">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>障害者加算（該当 <span id="res-disability-count">0</span>名）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-disability-addition">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row detail-sub" id="row-severe-disability" hidden>
            <span>うち重度障害者加算（16,560円×<span id="res-severe-count">0</span>名）</span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row" id="row-family-care" hidden>
            <span>障害者加算・家族介護（13,890円×<span id="res-family-care-count">0</span>名）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-family-care">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row" id="row-pregnancy" hidden>
            <span>妊産婦加算（該当 <span id="res-pregnancy-count">0</span>名）:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-pregnancy">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="detail-note" id="res-overlap-note" hidden>
            ※世帯主（1人目）が障害者加算と母子加算の両方に該当するため、いずれか高い方のみを算定しています（家族介護と、児童2人目以降の母子加算額は重複調整の対象外）。
          </p>
          <p class="detail-note" id="res-age-basis-note">
            ※児童は年齢のみで判定しています（18歳は年度末までとみなします）。生年月日を入力すると日付で判定します。
          </p>
          <p class="detail-note">
            ※介護人をつけるための費用、入院・施設入所中の方の基準、在宅患者加算等は試算に含みません。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. 住宅扶助（家賃補助・共益費） -->
      <div class="breakdown-item">
        <div class="item-main">
          <div class="item-label-group">
            <span class="item-name">住宅扶助（家賃支給額）</span>
            <span class="item-sub">大家・管理会社への家賃補助</span>
          </div>
          <span class="item-amount">¥<span id="res-housing-amount">0</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="item-details">
          <div class="detail-row">
            <span>自治体の上限基準額:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-housing-limit">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row" id="row-input-pure-rent">
            <span>入力された純賃料:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-input-pure-rent">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row" id="row-input-common-fee">
            <span>共益費・管理費:</span>
            <span>¥<span id="res-input-common-fee">0</span> (<span id="res-fee-type-desc">別払い</span>)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row text-warning" id="row-out-of-pocket-fee">
            <span>生活費からの共益費自己負担額:</span>
            <span>- ¥<span id="res-out-of-pocket-fee">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-row text-danger" id="row-excess-rent">
            <span>家賃上限超過分（自己負担）:</span>
            <span>- ¥<span id="res-excess-rent">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <p class="detail-note" id="res-housing-rule-explanation">
            ※共益費・管理費が別払いの場合は住宅扶助の支給対象外となり、生活費から自己負担となります。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .result-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .summary-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fff4e3 0%, #fbe6d2 100%);
    border: 2px solid var(--c-primary-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .summary-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .summary-badge {
    background-color: var(--c-primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.125rem 0.625rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .summary-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .total-amount-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--c-primary-hover);
  }

  .total-currency {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .total-number {
    font-size: 2.625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1.1;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .total-number {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
    }
  }

  .total-period {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    margin-left: 0.25rem;
  }

  .effective-living-bar {
    background-color: var(--c-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-green-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .effective-label-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .effective-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .effective-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
  }

  .effective-amount-box {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.125rem;
    color: var(--c-green);
  }

  .effective-currency {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .effective-number {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .effective-unit {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
  }

  .winter-hint-bar {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-s);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .winter-amount {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--c-primary-hover);
  }

  .breakdown-card {
    background-color: var(--c-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .breakdown-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-ink);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--c-line);
  }

  .breakdown-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .breakdown-item {
    background-color: var(--c-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-m);
    padding: 0.875rem;
  }

  .item-main {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .item-label-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .item-name {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .item-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
  }

  .item-amount {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--c-primary-hover);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .item-details {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--c-line-strong);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .detail-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .detail-row[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .detail-sub {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .text-warning {
    color: #8a4b00;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .text-danger {
    color: var(--c-danger);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .detail-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    margin: 0.375rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>

